      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='268' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='98000' id='267' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='9000' id='35' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='18'>User Cohorts Dashboard</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#ff2b85' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='55250' id='37' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='10000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>This dashboard provides a comprehensive view of time-based user cohorts, with a focus on acquisition cohorts. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d70f64' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Features:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>1. Acquisition Cohorts: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Groups of customers acquired in a certain month/week and their performance in subsequent months/weeks.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>- A cohort is 30d (month). Each cohort will include all users whose first valid platform order is within that month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>- The x-axis shows the period after acquisition. The month/week of acquisition will be 0, and subquently 1,2, and so on will represent 1 month after acquisition, 2 months after acquisition and so on. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>2. Acquisitions By Channel: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Number of acquisitions across channels. All online channels get their share from every single acquisition &amp; reorder. As attribution model 40-20-40 distribution is used for every touch point </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>1. Adoption Cohorts: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Groups of customers adopted to a certain vertical in a certain month/week and their performance in subsequent months/weeks.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>- A cohort is 30d (month). Each cohort will include all users whose first valid vertical order is within that month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>- The x-axis shows the period after adoption. The month/week of adoption will be 0, and subquently 1,2, and so on will represent 1 month after adoption, 2 months after adoption and so on.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Release Notes</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>27th Jan 2023 - </run>
                    <run auto-url='true' bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://jira.deliveryhero.com/browse/APM-728&amp;quot;'>https://jira.deliveryhero.com/browse/APM-728</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>2nd June 2022 - </run>
                    <run auto-url='true' bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://jira.deliveryhero.com/browse/APM-369&amp;quot;'>https://jira.deliveryhero.com/browse/APM-369</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>4th Feb 2022 - </run>
                    <run auto-url='true' bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://jira.deliveryhero.com/browse/APM-164&amp;quot;'>https://jira.deliveryhero.com/browse/APM-164</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>8th Feb 2022 - </run>
                    <run auto-url='true' bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://jira.deliveryhero.com/browse/APM-176&amp;quot;'>https://jira.deliveryhero.com/browse/APM-176</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>10th Mar 2022 - </run>
                    <run auto-url='true' bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://jira.deliveryhero.com/browse/APM-263&amp;quot;'>https://jira.deliveryhero.com/browse/APM-263</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>20th Feb 2022 - </run>
                    <run auto-url='true' bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://jira.deliveryhero.com/browse/APM-264&amp;quot;'>https://jira.deliveryhero.com/browse/APM-264</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
